ourcePayload\\\":{\\\"content\\\":\\\"두 이차함수 $f(x)=2x^2+3x+1$, $g(x)=-x^2+5x+9$의 교점 $x$좌표를 $\\\\\\\\alpha<\\\\\\\\beta$라 하자. $h(x)=g(x)-f(x)$의 $\\\\\\\\alpha\\\\\\\\le x\\\\\\\\le\\\\\\\\beta$에서의 최댓값은? (4.0점)\\\"},\\\"sourceRef\\\":{\\\"sourceArchiveFile\\\":\\\"exams/original/high/h1/1mid/26_복성고_1학기_중간_고1_기출.js\\\",\\\"sourceQuestionNo\\\":null,\\\"sourceQuestionOrdinal\\\":9,\\\"sourceQuestionUid\\\":\\\"legacy:exams/original/high/h1/1mid/26_복성고_1학기_중간_고1_기출.js#ordinal:9\\\"},\\\"wide\\\":false},{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"⑤\\\",\\\"choices\\\":[\\\"6\\\",\\\"8\\\",\\\"10\\\",\\\"12\\\",\\\"14\\\"],\\\"content\\\":\\\"다항식 $f(x)$를 $x-1$로 나누었을 때 몫은 $Q(x)$, 나머지는 4이다. $Q(x)$를 $x^2-5x+6$으로 나누었을 때 나머지가 $2x-1$이고, $f(x)$를 $x^2-4x+3$으로 나눈 나머지가 $R(x)$일 때, $R(3)$의 값은? (4.1점)\\\",\\\"displayNo\\\":10,\\\"layoutTag\\\":\\\"grid\\\",\\\"renderInput\\\":{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"⑤\\\",\\\"choices\\\":[\\\"6\\\",\\\"8\\\",\\\"10\\\",\\\"12\\\",\\\"14\\\"],\\\"content\\\":\\\"다항식 $f(x)$를 $x-1$로 나누었을 때 몫은 $Q(x)$, 나머지는 4이다. $Q(x)$를 $x^2-5x+6$으로 나누었을 때 나머지가 $2x-1$이고, $f(x)$를 $x^2-4x+3$으로 나눈 나머지가 $R(x)$일 때, $R(3)$의 값은? (4.1점)\\\",\\\"id\\\":10,\\\"layoutTag\\\":\\\"grid\\\",\\\"solution\\\":\\\"$f(x)=(x-1)Q(x)+4$이다.\\\\n$x^2-5x+6=(x-2)(x-3)$이므로 $Q(3)=2\\\\\\\\cdot3-1=5$이다.\\\\n따라서 $R(3)=f(3)=2\\\\\\\\cdot5+4=14$이므로 ⑤이다.\\\",\\\"wide\\\":false},\\\"solution\\\":\\\"$f(x)=(x-1)Q(x)+4$이다.\\\\n$x^2-5x+6=(x-2)(x-3)$이므로 $Q(3)=2\\\\\\\\cdot3-1=5$이다.\\\\n따라서 $R(3)=f(3)=2\\\\\\\\cdot5+4=14$이므로 ⑤이다.\\\",\\\"sourcePayload\\\":{\\\"content\\\":\\\"다항식 $f(x)$를 $x-1$로 나누었을 때 몫은 $Q(x)$, 나머지는 4이다. $Q(x)$를 $x^2-5x+6$으로 나누었을 때 나머지가 $2x-1$이고, $f(x)$를 $x^2-4x+3$으로 나눈 나머지가 $R(x)$일 때, $R(3)$의 값은? (4.1점)\\\"},\\\"sourceRef\\\":{\\\"sourceArchiveFile\\\":\\\"exams/original/high/h1/1mid/26_복성고_1학기_중간_고1_기출.js\\\",\\\"sourceQuestionNo\\\":null,\\\"sourceQuestionOrdinal\\\":10,\\\"sourceQuestionUid\\\":\\\"legacy:exams/original/high/h1/1mid/26_복성고_1학기_중간_고1_기출.js#ordinal:10\\\"},\\\"wide\\\":false},{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"③\\\",